  "notes": [
    "Gen 5 singles: Electivire's Last Resort, then Petilil's Copycat copies it. Petilil used Splash before, and Copycat's own PP spent at this action marks its slot used before the copied Last Resort's `onTry` (`deductPP` \u2192 `moveSlot.used`): every other move is used, so Last Resort strikes. The replay judges the `onTry` on the state after that spend (DESIGN.md R-M8-167)"
